---
title: Orchestration Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Router as Intent Router
    participant Orchestrator as Master Orchestrator
    participant Brain as Domain Brain
    participant Gov as Governance
    
    Client->>API: Request
    API->>Router: Route Intent
    Router->>Router: Classify Intent
    Router->>Orchestrator: Execute
    Orchestrator->>Gov: Validate Rules
    Gov-->>Orchestrator: Approved
    Orchestrator->>Brain: Query Knowledge
    Brain-->>Orchestrator: Knowledge Response
    Orchestrator-->>API: Result
    API-->>Client: Response
